              "id": "F002",
              "statement": "Every scalar bscalar with u_tt(x,t)−Δ_xu(x,t)=bscalar u(x,t) equals Σ_{j=1}^n|∂_{x_j}u(x,t)|²−|u_t(x,t)|².",
